==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Vivid Voltage|Flareon|26}} from the {{TCG|Vivid Voltage}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Flareon}}.
*'''Assisting Heater''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Lost Thunder|Moltres|38}} from the {{TCG|Lost Thunder}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

